# FieldFlix Admin Web Configuration
#
# Production / Vercel: set this to the AWS API (required at build time).
VITE_API_URL=https://api.fieldflicks.com

# Local dev: leave empty to use Vite proxy (vite.config.ts → api.fieldflicks.com),
# or set VITE_API_URL=https://api.fieldflicks.com to call the API directly.
